{"version":1,"content":"<p>Claude 5.2「雙子星」一扔出來，AI圈又熱鬧了！今早，Anthropic終於放出了下一代雙旗艦——Fable 5.2和Mythos 5.2。不光30小時搞定費馬大定理形式化，Anthropic新雙王Fable 5.2和Mythos 5.2這次是真長出雙手了！官方剛剛放出的四場預發佈「實戰大考」，把整個工程界和理科圈都鎮住了。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1585742.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.118613+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":172,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T06:37:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_hash":"2d70e4161067bd44291947a93080df8c50843076f1df6d2a7bb9c3b3b69d5df9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}